---
// Pi + Magpie 分层架构图（自适应深浅色主题）
---

<figure class="not-prose my-6 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50/70 p-4 sm:p-6 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/50">
  <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
    <span class="font-semibold tracking-wide text-zinc-700 uppercase dark:text-zinc-300">Architecture</span>
    <span>Pi（终端执行） × Magpie（中枢调度）</span>
  </div>

  <!-- 上层：Pi 终端执行层 -->
  <div class="rounded-xl border border-sky-500/30 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs dark:bg-zinc-950/80">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500"></span>
        <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Pi（pi-coding-agent）</span>
      </div>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-sky-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-sky-700 dark:bg-sky-500/15 dark:text-sky-300">
        终端极速执行内核
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60">
        <div class="font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">交互与可读性</div>
        <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">紧凑 TUI · 选项提问 · 会话命名</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60">
        <div class="font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">检索与外部联动</div>
        <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">FFF 模糊搜索 · 浏览器 · MCP</div>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60">
        <div class="font-medium text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">协作与控本</div>
        <div class="mt-0.5 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">双模型把关 · 子代理 · 省 Token</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 连接桥 -->
  <div class="my-2.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
    <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800"></span>
    <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-3 py-0.5 font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300">
      ↕ 模型路由 · 全局规范 · 产物 / 能力注入
    </span>
    <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800"></span>
  </div>

  <!-- 下层：Magpie 中枢 -->
  <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs dark:bg-zinc-950/80">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="inline-block h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
        <span class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Magpie</span>
      </div>
      <span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:text-emerald-300">
        调度与工作台中枢
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-4">
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 px-2.5 py-2 text-center text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:text-zinc-300">
        多模型路由组
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 px-2.5 py-2 text-center text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:text-zinc-300">
        全局 AGENTS.md
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 px-2.5 py-2 text-center text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:text-zinc-300">
        Artifact / 浏览器
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-zinc-200/80 bg-zinc-50 px-2.5 py-2 text-center text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/60 dark:text-zinc-300">
        生图 / 定时任务
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
    图 1：Pi 专注终端内的轻量编码闭环，Magpie 负责多模型调度、全局规范与高频周边能力
  </figcaption>
</figure>
